  "version": "0.9.10",
  "notes": "Avoid repeating failed worker connection checks within a chat turn while retrying the PC on the next question. Save the actual answering model and host/worker on each new reply; distinguish current availability in the phone header. Add private typed connection diagnostics and turn IDs, remove a redundant worker health inventory request, and preserve chats, memories and configuration. The measured slow reply used laptop fallback; the underlying PC connection failure remains under investigation.",
